{"skill":{"slug":"woocommerce","displayName":"WooCommerce"},"version":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790940987630,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":84334,"sha256":"d8492a027b2d8ab8de399a2bbb89044f3b50c831c3e4ea03fcf9a9be7c525630","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2183,"sha256":"d89e362a712ee0b11370dd6ec43ca59e5099b65ce554ea2cd5bb8ff1efae2419","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790946067423,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"1e8b64ac70e475180f04e32662e9af91ac7b28a3f576de6bd857c92e73bb59c7","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/1e8b64ac70e475180f04e32662e9af91ac7b28a3f576de6bd857c92e73bb59c7","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790945211026},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790946067423},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This WooCommerce skill is a disclosed Maton API integration that can affect store data, but it consistently requires user authorization and approval for changes.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access, a Maton account, and WooCommerce authorization are proportionate for a WooCommerce API integration. The raw HTTP fallback is limited to cases where the CLI cannot be installed and includes API-key handling warnings.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Installation uses pinned Maton CLI packages via npm or Homebrew, followed by OAuth login. The artifact itself is Markdown-only and contains no executable files.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The instructions default to read/list operations, require explicit confirmation for writes and new connections, warn against handling PII unnecessarily, and treat external payload content as untrusted data. Platform function and trigger sections are scoped to user-requested automation.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"OAuth tokens are stored in the OS credential store, and connections, functions, triggers, destinations, and WooCommerce webhooks can persist. These behaviors are disclosed and repeatedly tied to explicit user approval rather than hidden persistence.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill enables WooCommerce REST API access for products, orders, customers, coupons, shipping, taxes, reports, webhooks, payment gateways, settings, and system status through Maton. These are high-impact e-commerce capabilities, but they match the stated purpose and are disclosed.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you trust Maton and intend to connect a WooCommerce store. Review requested WooCommerce scopes, prefer the OAuth CLI flow over long-lived API keys, and approve writes, refunds, settings changes, functions, triggers, destinations, or webhooks only after seeing the exact target and effect. Customer and order data contains PII, and webhooks or trigger destinations can forward future events persistently until removed.","findings":"[SkillSpector] expected: The supplied SkillSpector report contained no issues, and artifact inspection did not find hidden or purpose-mismatched behavior.\n[aig-skill-scan] expected: The supplied SARIF results were empty; local inspection found Markdown documentation and trigger references only, with no executable artifact files.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790946067423}}}}}